### =======================================
### NgiNep Hotel Service - API Testing
### Port: 8082
### Gunakan file ini di IntelliJ (HTTP Client)
### Klik tombol "Run" (hijau) di sebelah kiri tiap request
###
### ⚠️  Untuk endpoint protected, login dulu
###     di user-service (port 8081), lalu
###     copy token ke variabel @token di bawah
### =======================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082
@token = paste_token_jwt_kamu_di_sini_tanpa_tanda_kutip

### ==========================================
### CITY — Kota (Publik: GET, Admin: POST/PUT/DELETE)
### ==========================================

### 1. Lihat semua kota (untuk dropdown form Register/Profil/Hotel)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cities

###

### 2. Lihat kota by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cities/1

###

### 3. Tambah kota baru — Hanya ROLE_ADMIN_APP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bandung",
  "province": "Jawa Barat"
}

###

### 4. Update kota — Hanya ROLE_ADMIN_APP
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/cities/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bandung",
  "province": "Jawa Barat"
}

###

### 5. Hapus kota — Hanya ROLE_ADMIN_APP
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cities/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==========================================
### FACILITY — Fasilitas (Publik: GET, Admin: POST/PUT/DELETE)
### ==========================================

###

### 6. Lihat semua fasilitas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/facilities

###

### 7. Tambah fasilitas — Hanya ROLE_ADMIN_APP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/facilities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Free WiFi",
  "icon": "wifi"
}

###

### 8. Update fasilitas — Hanya ROLE_ADMIN_APP
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/facilities/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Free WiFi",
  "icon": "wifi"
}

###

### 9. Hapus fasilitas — Hanya ROLE_ADMIN_APP
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/facilities/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==========================================
### HOTEL — Hotel (Publik: GET, Admin Hotel/App: POST/PUT/DELETE)
### ==========================================

###

### 10. Lihat semua hotel
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hotels

###

### 11. Cari hotel berdasarkan keyword nama
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hotels?keyword=Grand

###

### 12. Filter hotel berdasarkan kota
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hotels?cityId=1

###

### 13. Lihat hotel yang featured (untuk homepage)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hotels/featured

###

### 14. Lihat detail hotel by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hotels/1

###

### 15. Tambah hotel baru — ROLE_ADMIN_HOTEL atau ROLE_ADMIN_APP
### city dikirim sebagai objek dengan id_city
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hotels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Grand Hotel Bandung",
  "city": { "id_city": 1 },
  "address": "Jl. Asia Afrika No. 10, Bandung",
  "type": "Bintang 4",
  "description": "Hotel mewah di pusat kota Bandung dengan pemandangan gunung yang indah.",
  "admin_hotel_id": 1,
  "featured": true,
  "onSale": false,
  "discount_percent": 0,
  "rating": 4.5
}

###

### 16. Update hotel — ROLE_ADMIN_HOTEL atau ROLE_ADMIN_APP
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/hotels/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Grand Hotel Bandung Updated",
  "city": { "id_city": 1 },
  "address": "Jl. Asia Afrika No. 10, Bandung",
  "type": "Bintang 5",
  "description": "Hotel mewah bintang 5 di pusat kota Bandung.",
  "onSale": true,
  "discount_percent": 10,
  "rating": 4.8
}

###

### 17. Hapus hotel — ROLE_ADMIN_HOTEL atau ROLE_ADMIN_APP
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/hotels/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==========================================
### ROOM TYPE — Tipe Kamar
### ==========================================

###

### 18. Lihat semua tipe kamar milik hotel tertentu
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/room-types/hotel/1

###

### 19. Lihat detail tipe kamar by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/room-types/1

###

### 20. Tambah tipe kamar — ROLE_ADMIN_HOTEL atau ROLE_ADMIN_APP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/room-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hotel": { "id_hotel": 1 },
  "name": "Deluxe Room",
  "price_per_night": 500000,
  "room_available": 10,
  "max_guest": 2,
  "smoking": false,
  "description": "Kamar deluxe dengan pemandangan kota dan fasilitas lengkap."
}

###

### 21. Update tipe kamar — ROLE_ADMIN_HOTEL atau ROLE_ADMIN_APP
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/room-types/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Deluxe Room",
  "price_per_night": 550000,
  "room_available": 8,
  "max_guest": 2,
  "smoking": false,
  "description": "Kamar deluxe dengan harga update."
}

###

### 22. Hapus tipe kamar — ROLE_ADMIN_HOTEL atau ROLE_ADMIN_APP
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/room-types/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
